{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261104/photo/bkn-20261104232705314-1104_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261105001514\"/><p>涉賭被捕男女。</p><p>將軍澳區警員今日（4日）在區內展開打擊非法賭博行動，於清水灣道一村屋成功搗破一個懷疑非法賭檔。警員拘捕7名本地男子、1名內地男子及7名本地女子，年齡介乎28至68歲，涉嫌「在賭場以外任何場所或在街道上進行賭博」。被捕人現正被扣留調查。行動中，檢獲一批懷疑賭具及現金。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T16:45:49.847762+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T15:27:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T16:38:48.523936+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T16:38:48.523936+00:00","content_hash":"cb808b57f912f6eaaba8e2752bef034e54f7b37f3b31644f7863ee1d2e47d85f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}